# 换行符统一为 LF。
#
# Prettier 配了 endOfLine: "lf"，而 Windows 上 core.autocrlf=true 会把检出内容
# 转成 CRLF，导致同一份代码在本机 format:check 失败、在 CI（Linux）却通过，
# 并且 git diff 会把整文件标成改动。gitattributes 的优先级高于 core.autocrlf。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须保持 CRLF，否则解释器会出错
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不做任何换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.bmp binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.xlsx binary
*.docx binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.so binary
*.pyd binary
*.pyc binary
